the CRV bar geometry in crvfastsim/geometry.py follows GeometryService/src/CosmicRayShieldMaker.cc, and the art
modules in art/CrvFastSim use Offline data products and services.

Mu2e-internal inputs (CRV conditions and photon lookup tables, detector data) are not part of this repository and
must not be added to it.
